+-- Refactors the rev0678 destination-only probe into `SyncManifestFilesystemProbe` and `verify_manifest_filesystem_or_throw`, shared by `source` and `destination_after` manifest roles.
+-- Makes `load_sync_session_checkpoint_resume_view` inspect persisted `source` rows against `source_root_path` and persisted `destination_after` rows against `destination_root_path`.
+-- Rejects missing source files, wrong-kind replacements, symlink-substitution boundaries, and content hash/size drift when strict source filesystem matching is required.
+-- Preserves advisory modes: callers may disable strict source or destination matching and still receive drift counters/paths without rejecting the view.
+-- Keeps checkpoint schema metadata at `rev0677-sync-session-checkpoint-v2`; rev0679 changes read-time restart semantics, not durable row layout.
